Usage: serve [options]

Serves a model

Options:
  -p, --port PORT        port [default: 8080] [min: 0, max: 65535]
      --threads THREADS  worker threads (at least one) [default: 1] [min: 1]
      --ctx CTX          context size [default: 0]
      --temp TEMP        temperature [default: 0.8] [min: 0.0, max: 2.0]
      --stats on|off     print statistics [default: off]
      --dir DIR          model folder
  -h, --help             show this help
